<title>USA: Rockwell completes sale of Rockwell Graphic.</title>
<headline>Rockwell completes sale of Rockwell Graphic.</headline>
<dateline>WESTMONT, Ill. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rockwell International Corp said it completed the sale of Rockwell Graphic Systems to its management group and Stonington Partners, creating a privately held company to be known as Goss Graphic Systems Inc.</p>
<p>The new company manufactures newspaper and commercial printing press systems.</p>
<p>The transaction was valued at about $600 million.</p>
<p>Graphic Systems had sales of about $700 million in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
